  partName: Blade25
  description: The Blade26 is an elongated, tiny component situated at the middle-center-front
    of the jet engine, fabricated from Blades texture material, which works in tandem
    with other blades to compress and direct air towards the combustion chamber.
    Its precise shape and size allow for seamless integration with adjacent components,
    ensuring smooth engine operation. Interestingly, the Blade26 is designed to be
    interchangeable with other blades, facilitating maintenance and reducing downtime.
